<title>USA: TABLE - Equifax Inc Q2 oper shr risees.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Equifax Inc Q2 oper shr risees.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.42		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net shr		     0.39		     0.28</p>
